<div class="hero">
  <h1>LangGraph State &amp; LLM Abstraction</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">graph/state.py · llm/models.py</p>
  <p>The shared nervous system — how 19 agents coordinate through typed state and how one factory function connects to 13 LLM providers.</p>
  <div style="margin-top:1rem">
    <span class="badge red">AgentState TypedDict</span>
    <span class="badge blue">13 LLM Providers</span>
